sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Applicant
    participant W as Web portal
    participant A as SAMAR API
    participant G as ICICI EazyPay
    participant E as Business Central

    U->>W: chooses to pay
    W->>A: requests fee quote
    A-->>W: returns calculated fee
    U->>W: confirms payment
    W->>A: initiates payment
    A->>A: recalculates fee and freezes breakdown
    A-->>W: returns encrypted gateway link
    W->>G: redirects applicant
    U->>G: pays

    G-->>A: returns applicant with signed result
    G-->>A: sends server confirmation
    A->>A: verifies signature
    A->>A: marks payment successful
    A->>E: raises invoice and receipt
    A-->>U: emails confirmation
